  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity SOUTH ASIA REGIONAL TRADE AND INTEGRATION (SARTIP) - ASIA DEVELOPMENT BANK is a component of SOUTH ASIA REGIONAL TRADE AND INTEGRATION PROGRAMME reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;657,624. This project benefits Asia, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Trade facilitation, Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Trade policy and administrative management.</narrative>
